{"title":"2024 IMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution（Fermat&#39;s_little_theorem，In_English）\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution（Fermat's little theorem，In English）</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution（Fermat&#39;s_little_theorem，In_Chinese）\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution（Fermat's little theorem，In Chinese）</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all positive integer pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/e/53e0f8ffb1b6122cfe313d7a1e2d44f2b1550b8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"18\" /> such that there exists positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/c/cec193846df0a219752063b5ccaf0a20830e8b70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g,N,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/4/1f4ed3e8276279d224eb603b60082fa40dd2e0af.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\gcd (a^n+b,b^n+a)=g\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"18\" />\nholds for all integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/845c0da210ec3bb12d45628b74e37402799d9695.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We will determine all pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> of positive integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/1/3f1f896d865dd6f5536955f63763e8c81059eb7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a^n+b,b^n+a)=g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"182\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/1/9215186a5b621d0bda7948d36d29fb65b219f445.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>First, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/7/ae7a465ffe5255961382f5777569608be052b783.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> works with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b83776948a48c5f5319b185ffbc1c80393a85631.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />. Now for any solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />:\n</p><p>Lemma&#160;: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/d/9bd3b72b56229b3d1e1b3192a8d8aeb0c336a854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g = \\gcd(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/e/9feaf3aa461af7e0b3a53556687950ce258e1e8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g = 2\\gcd(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Proof&#160;: \nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> divides both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/7/a67114b83904d515b85784e44846bc8a652ffaf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^N+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"54\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/d/ecd26a4d411ccb0e5681a546fe35e44c3ef59051.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{N+1}+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"19\" />, it divides their difference <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/5/f75b59217fada606e8792b25cbabaa5cf106b783.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^N(a-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"22\" />. Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/0/a00856c9fa0817e30d57acaabc95962fcf46312a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^N(b-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"22\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a697bfdeadf2105048670e6f6c7d4dc6878dc4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/b/73bd10597cd94b256d62fc1b3d08aab8b6dd3a0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^N+b-(a-b)=a^N+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"208\" height=\"22\" />. Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/e/9fe0530333b1a595a08fef85856e7d3bb7441b86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a^N+a,a)=\\gcd(a,a-1)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"273\" height=\"22\" />, a contradiction unless <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> divides both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a100b66460548e203af82f006d6122636467168.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=\\gcd(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" /> and write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/9/28986b2ec4a18f39ac0330d48b7fc5dd818f21b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=dx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/e/e4ef47570f4b5a4862c33a280ad51f6b58187004.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=dy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/3/8435f42a4f0210c104760ca8bf732716c92f8bdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(x,y)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"105\" height=\"20\" />. Then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/9/b59b9ac28043d83f7e5266d6724f4951a6a3f321.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\gcd(a^n+b,b^n+a) = d \\cdot \\gcd(d^{n-1}x^n+y, d^{n-1}y^n+x)\\]\" width=\"415\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Using Euler's theorem, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/0/9b010fb00438463df65e8393f6dd3c597d911a7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv -1 \\pmod{\\varphi(K)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"20\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfb226e8525e96b41a1c3052038112a7a16f7aa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K=d^2xy+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\" />, we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/1/1511b4b31d4300e00c40ea2ecb9333864eec411a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[d^{n-1}x^n+y \\equiv d^{-2}x^{-1}+y \\equiv d^{-2}x^{-1}(1+d^2xy) \\equiv 0 \\pmod{K}\\]\" width=\"481\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/d/86d1bc8f673baf282683819485b56641e1cbc0c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d^{n-1}y^n+x \\equiv 0 \\pmod{K}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"202\" height=\"21\" />. Since these are divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> must divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/c/d4cfa49c95a127c657f681b8b54b33728e4c5d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g \\leq 2d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/d/7adc77fbc553f1e24f1036fcb38f920b6b68d59a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=x=y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"113\" height=\"18\" />, giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7f31d91ef7804079a6343d10d3a80cccd445f02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(1,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>~brandonyee\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VXFG1t_ksfI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VXFG1t_ksfI</a> (including motivation to derive solution)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.EF.BC.88Fermat.27s_little_theorem.EF.BC.8CIn_English.EF.BC.89\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution（Fermat's_little_theorem，In_English）\">Video Solution（Fermat's little theorem，In English）</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution（Fermat&#39;s little theorem，In English）\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/QTBcTtY46HI\">https://youtu.be/QTBcTtY46HI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.EF.BC.88Fermat.27s_little_theorem.EF.BC.8CIn_Chinese.EF.BC.89\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution（Fermat's_little_theorem，In_Chinese）\">Video Solution（Fermat's little theorem，In Chinese）</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution（Fermat&#39;s little theorem，In Chinese）\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/8WOff2j0giY\">https://youtu.be/8WOff2j0giY</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5SZUbbxoK1M\">https://youtu.be/5SZUbbxoK1M</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO\" title=\"2024 IMO\">2024 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2024 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2024 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2024 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018023409\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 252/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 894/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip 